DETAILED DESCRIPTION

Referring now to the drawings and more particularly to FIGS. 1-3, a fluid system 10 is illustrated and includes a variable displacement axial piston pump 12 that receives fluid from a tank 14 via a conduit 16 and delivers pressurized fluid via a supply conduit 18 to a fluid control valve 20 and selectively through work conduits 22, 24 to a fluid actuator 26.
